  <</if>>
  <<if _sydneyChastity and C.npc.Sydney.chastity.anus.includes('shield')>>
    <<set $enemyarousalmax -= 100>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $passagePrev is 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Night Wake'>>
        Sydney checks that you want to stay close. <<He>> waits for your answer before kissing you beneath the blanket. The rest of the house is quiet.
      <<else>>
        Sydney checks that you still want to continue before drawing you onto the bed. The papers on the desk stir in the draught from the window.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        "<span class='teal'>Tell me if you want to stop</span>," <<he>> whispers.
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        "<span class='lewd'>You really did stay</span>," <<he>> murmurs with a smile, pulling you close.
      <<else>>
        Sydney takes a breath and kisses you, still holding your hand.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $passagePrev is 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Night Wake'>>
        悉尼确认你想继续靠近，等你回答，才在被子下吻了过来。屋里其余地方静悄悄的。
      <<else>>
        悉尼确认你仍愿意继续，才把你带到床上。窗缝透进的风轻轻吹动书桌上的纸张。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        “<span class='teal'>想、想停的话，告诉我。</span>”<<he>>轻声说，声音有些不稳。
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        “<span class='lewd'>你还真留下了。</span>”<<he>>笑着说，把你拉近。
      <<else>>
        悉尼深吸一口气，仍握着你的手，吻了过来。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<if _sydneyChastity and $sydneyChastityKnown>>
    <br><br><span class='teal'>
      <<lanSwitch "As Sydney settles beside you, you feel the familiar lock at Sydney's waist. Sydney sees that you have noticed and leaves your hand there." '悉尼在你身旁躺下时，你碰到那枚熟悉的腰间锁扣。悉尼知道你察觉了，仍让你的手留在那里。'>>
    </span>
  <<elseif _sydneyChastity>>
    <br><br><span class='lewd'>
      <<lanSwitch "Your fingers brush something hard beneath Sydney's clothes. Sydney catches your hand and waits for you to look up." '你的指尖隔着悉尼的衣服碰到硬物。悉尼握住你的手，等你抬头看过来。'>>
    </span>
  <<elseif $sydneyChastityKnown>>
    <br><br><span class='teal'>
      <<lanSwitch "The lock you remember is gone. Sydney draws you closer without its metal edge between you." '你记得的锁扣已经不在了。悉尼把你拉近，腰间再没有那道金属边缘。'>>
    </span>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
